<title>UK: Bernard Matthews warns on Q2 results.</title>
<headline>Bernard Matthews warns on Q2 results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food manufacturer Bernard Matthews Plc said on Thursday that second quarter results are unlikely to match those of last year.  </p>
<p>&quot;This may have an adverse effect on the first half profits,&quot; chairman Bernard Matthews told shareholders at the company's annual meeting (AGM).</p>
<p>However, the company said it remained &quot;cautiously optimistic&quot; for the year as a whole.</p>
<p>At 1206 GMT, the company's shares were quoted off 12-1/2p at 127p.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
